(61912,619,'The point about ambiguous technical responsibility is not quite as clear-cut as it first appears.','Điểm về trách nhiệm kỹ thuật mơ hồ không hoàn toàn rạch ròi như lúc đầu.','/ðə pɔɪnt əˈbaʊt æmˈbɪgjuəs ˈtɛknɪkəl riˌspɑnsəˈbɪləti ɪz nɑt kwaɪt ɛz klɪr kət ɛz ɪt fərst əˈpɪrz/','','PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
