(1030,1,'I would argue that the additional work needs a separate agreement.','How should we approach the scope of the service?'),
(1030,2,'One reason is that the original quote covers a limited set of tasks.','What supports that view?'),
(1030,3,'We should remember that the client may expect a broader service.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1030,4,'One possibility would be a written change request.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1031,1,'I would argue that the customer should review the conditions before booking.','How should we approach the cancellation terms?'),
(1031,2,'One reason is that different services have different cancellation rules.','What supports that view?'),
(1031,3,'We should remember that some circumstances may require individual review.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1031,4,'One possibility would be a clear explanation of the applicable policy.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1032,1,'I would argue that we should agree on acceptance criteria in advance.','How should we approach the delivery deadline?'),
(1032,2,'One reason is that a deadline alone does not define a successful delivery.','What supports that view?'),
(1032,3,'We should remember that requirements may change during development.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1032,4,'One possibility would be a phased delivery plan.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1033,1,'I would argue that a controlled rollout would reduce operational risk.','How should we approach the software release?'),
(1033,2,'One reason is that testing cannot reproduce every production condition.','What supports that view?'),
(1033,3,'We should remember that a slower release may affect the schedule.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1033,4,'One possibility would be a monitored pilot release.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1034,1,'I would argue that the patient needs a clear explanation before deciding.','How should we approach patient consent?'),
(1034,2,'One reason is that technical language can be difficult to understand.','What supports that view?'),
(1034,3,'We should remember that staff cannot assume that silence means agreement.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1034,4,'One possibility would be a discussion with an appropriate clinician.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1035,1,'I would argue that the receiving clinic should confirm the required records.','How should we approach the referral process?'),
(1035,2,'One reason is that incomplete information may delay the appointment.','What supports that view?'),
(1035,3,'We should remember that confidential records need an approved transfer method.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1035,4,'One possibility would be a secure transfer arranged by the records team.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1036,1,'I would argue that students should understand how their work will be judged.','How should we approach the assessment criteria?'),
(1036,2,'One reason is that unclear criteria make feedback harder to interpret.','What supports that view?'),
(1036,3,'We should remember that different tasks may require different evidence.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1036,4,'One possibility would be an annotated example of the expected standard.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1037,1,'I would argue that responsibilities should reflect both skills and availability.','How should we approach the division of group tasks?'),
(1037,2,'One reason is that equal numbers of tasks do not always mean equal effort.','What supports that view?'),
(1037,3,'We should remember that some contributions are less visible than others.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1037,4,'One possibility would be a shared record of responsibilities and progress.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1038,1,'I would argue that availability expectations should be stated clearly.','How should we approach working hours?'),
(1038,2,'One reason is that informal expectations can create misunderstandings.','What supports that view?'),
(1038,3,'We should remember that urgent situations may still require flexibility.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1038,4,'One possibility would be an agreed procedure for urgent requests.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1039,1,'I would argue that feedback should focus on observable actions.','How should we approach constructive feedback?'),
(1039,2,'One reason is that personal judgements rarely suggest a practical improvement.','What supports that view?'),
(1039,3,'We should remember that a direct message may sound harsher than intended.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1039,4,'One possibility would be a specific example followed by a workable suggestion.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1040,1,'I would argue that the bank should explain the available review channels.','How should we approach the complaint procedure?'),
(1040,2,'One reason is that customers need to know how their concern is recorded.','What supports that view?'),
(1040,3,'We should remember that an investigation may take time.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1040,4,'One possibility would be a written acknowledgement with a reference number.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1041,1,'I would argue that the customer should compare the written terms carefully.','How should we approach the product conditions?'),
(1041,2,'One reason is that headline figures may not describe all relevant charges.','What supports that view?'),
(1041,3,'We should remember that the product may not suit every financial situation.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1041,4,'One possibility would be a review of the terms with a qualified adviser.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1042,1,'I would argue that we should distinguish the cause from its consequences.','How should we approach the delivery delay?'),
(1042,2,'One reason is that the tracking record may show several contributing events.','What supports that view?'),
(1042,3,'We should remember that one missing update does not prove the parcel is lost.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1042,4,'One possibility would be a coordinated review with the carrier.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1043,1,'I would argue that each party should confirm its obligations in writing.','How should we approach shipping responsibilities?'),
(1043,2,'One reason is that unclear handovers can lead to duplicated or missed tasks.','What supports that view?'),
(1043,3,'We should remember that commercial terms need to be checked in the agreement.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1043,4,'One possibility would be a responsibility checklist reviewed by both parties.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1044,1,'I would argue that staff should explain the options that are actually available.','How should we approach a room change request?'),
(1044,2,'One reason is that promising an unavailable room would cause further frustration.','What supports that view?'),
(1044,3,'We should remember that the guest may need an immediate practical solution.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1044,4,'One possibility would be a temporary arrangement while availability is checked.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1045,1,'I would argue that the organisers should communicate any change promptly.','How should we approach the event schedule?'),
(1045,2,'One reason is that speakers and guests rely on accurate timing information.','What supports that view?'),
(1045,3,'We should remember that not every participant will see the same notification.','What limitation should we consider?'),
(1045,4,'One possibility would be a consistent update through several approved channels.','What other option could we explore?'),
(1046,1,'I would argue that we should avoid drawing a strong conclusion from a small sample.','How should we approach campaign performance?'),
(1046,2,'One reason is that short-term results can be affected by several factors.','What supports that view?'),
