(1105,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that the interviewer may have omitted a workable middle course.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1105,3,'It overlooks a complication: refusing the framing can look like avoiding the question.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1105,4,'We could instead consider a direct answer that introduces the missing distinction.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1106,1,'I would be inclined to argue that the same facts may require different phrasing for different audiences.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of register and audience?'),
(1106,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that shared background determines which details need explanation.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1106,3,'It overlooks a complication: a change of register must not change the underlying meaning.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1106,4,'We could instead consider parallel versions that preserve the same factual commitments.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1107,1,'I would be inclined to argue that a credible response should neither minimise nor exaggerate the concern.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of crisis communication?'),
(1107,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that both reassurance and alarm can outrun the known facts.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1107,3,'It overlooks a complication: waiting for complete certainty may leave a damaging information gap.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1107,4,'We could instead consider a factual update that distinguishes knowledge from ongoing inquiry.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1108,1,'I would be inclined to argue that compression should preserve the distinctions that carry the argument.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of a nuanced summary?'),
(1108,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that an omitted qualification can reverse the apparent conclusion.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1108,3,'It overlooks a complication: a summary cannot reproduce every detail of the original.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1108,4,'We could instead consider a concise account that retains the decisive qualifications.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1109,1,'I would be inclined to argue that a review should establish responsibility without reducing the problem to a scapegoat.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of accountability without scapegoating?'),
(1109,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that systemic conditions may matter alongside individual decisions.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1109,3,'It overlooks a complication: systemic explanations must not erase individual agency.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1109,4,'We could instead consider a review that separates causes, responsibilities and remedies.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1110,1,'I would be inclined to argue that tact can strengthen rather than dilute a difficult message.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of face-saving feedback?'),
(1110,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that a recipient who feels attacked may miss the practical point.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1110,3,'It overlooks a complication: excessive cushioning may obscure the required change.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1110,4,'We could instead consider a respectful statement of the specific behaviour and its effect.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1111,1,'I would be inclined to argue that silence should not be treated as unqualified consent.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of silence in a meeting?'),
(1111,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that a participant may be uncertain or reluctant to challenge authority.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1111,3,'It overlooks a complication: pressing for an immediate answer can compound the discomfort.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1111,4,'We could instead consider a private or delayed opportunity to express reservations.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1112,1,'I would be inclined to argue that equal treatment and equitable outcomes are not always identical.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of competing notions of fairness?'),
(1112,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that people may apply different standards without stating them.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1112,3,'It overlooks a complication: a flexible standard can appear arbitrary if poorly explained.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
(1112,4,'We could instead consider an explicit discussion of the relevant fairness principle.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1113,1,'I would be inclined to argue that a mediator should clarify interests without pretending the conflict has vanished.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of mediation between entrenched positions?'),
(1113,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that superficial agreement may only postpone the disagreement.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
