(1114,1,'I would be inclined to argue that a precise figure can still be misunderstood without its reference point.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of the interpretation of risk figures?'),
(1114,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that relative and absolute changes answer different questions.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
(1114,3,'It overlooks a complication: adding every statistic may overwhelm rather than inform.','Where might that line of reasoning come unstuck?'),
