(1115,1,'I would be inclined to argue that a preference should not be presented as a guaranteed outcome.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of trade-offs under uncertainty?'),
(1115,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that the future conditions may differ from the assumptions.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
