(1117,1,'I would be inclined to argue that the nature and limits of the statement should be unmistakable.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of advice and personal opinion?'),
(1117,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that a confident tone can give an opinion unwarranted authority.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
