(1117,4,'We could instead consider a clear statement of scope with a referral where appropriate.','What would a less clear-cut formulation look like?'),
(1118,1,'I would be inclined to argue that the qualification should be as clear as the headline claim.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of qualifications in fee explanations?'),
