(1120,1,'I would be inclined to argue that a useful tool need not be either infallible or worthless.','What, precisely, is at stake in our discussion of the limits of automation?'),
(1120,2,'My reasoning rests on the fact that a binary description obscures the conditions under which it helps.','On what grounds would you defend that reading?'),
